#: ../../administration/settings/settings.rst:2
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Configuración"

#: ../../administration/settings/settings.rst:4
msgid ""
"The |AdmSet| section sets global configuration parameters for the |morpheus|"
" appliance, whitelabeling, provisioning, monitoring, backups, logs, software"
" licenses, and the license for |morpheus| itself."
msgstr ""
"El |AdmSet| sección sets global configuración parameters para el |morpheus| "
"appliance, marca blancaing, aprovisionamiento, monitoreo, backups, logs, "
"software licencias, y el licencia para |morpheus| itself."

#: ../../administration/settings/settings.rst:7
msgid "Appliance"
msgstr "Appliance"

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:2
msgid "Appliance Settings"
msgstr "Appliance Configuración"

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:5
msgid "Appliance URL"
msgstr "Appliance URL"

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:5
msgid ""
"The default URL used for Agent install and Agent functionality. All "
"Instances and Hosts must be able to resolve and reach this URL over 443 for "
"successful agent install and communication."
msgstr ""
"El predeterminado URL usado para Agent install y Agent functionality. Todos "
"Instancias y Hosts debe ser able a resolve y reach este URL over 443 para "
"successful agent install y communication."

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:7
msgid ""
"Alternate Appliance URLs can be configured per Cloud in the `Edit Cloud > "
"Advanced Options` section."
msgstr ""
"Alternate Appliance URLs se puede configurar per Nube en el `Editar Nube > "
"Advanced Opciones` sección."

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:9
msgid "Internal Appliance URL (PXE)"
msgstr "Internal Appliance URL (PXE)"

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:10
msgid ""
"For PXE-Boot your appliance needs to be routable directly with minimal NAT "
"masquerading. This allows one to override the default appliance url endpoint"
" for use by the PXE Server. If this is unset, the default appliance url will"
" be used instead."
msgstr ""
"Para PXE-Boot su appliance needs a be routable directly con minimal NAT "
"masquerading. Este permite uno a override el predeterminado appliance url "
"endpoint para usar por el PXE Servidor. Si este es unset, el predeterminado "
"appliance url será usado instead."

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:11
msgid "API Allowed Origins"
msgstr "API Allowed Origins"

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:12
msgid ""
"A CORS-related field which specifies the origins that are allowed to access "
"the |morpheus| API. For example, if you were designing a web application "
"which needed to make AJAX calls to |morpheus| API. The origins should be "
"specified here. By default, all origins are allowed. When this field is "
"filled, an exclusive whitelist of allowed origins is established."
msgstr ""
"Un CORS-related campo que specifies el origins ese son allowed a acceso el "
"|morpheus| API. Por ejemplo, si usted fueron designing a web application que"
" needed a make AJAX calls a |morpheus| API. El origins debería ser specified"
" here. De forma predeterminada, todos origins son allowed. Cuando este campo"
" es filled, un exclusive whitelist de allowed origins es established."

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:13
msgid "Cloud Sync Interval"
msgstr "Nube Sync Interval"

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:14
msgid ""
"Data is refreshed through cloud integrations at the interval specified here "
"in seconds, the default value is 300 seconds (five minutes). Appliances "
"managing a very large number of clouds may be adversely affected by setting "
"this value too low."
msgstr ""
"Data es refreshed a través de cloud integraciones en el interval specified "
"here en seconds, el predeterminado valor es 300 seconds (five minutes). "
"Appliances managing a very large número de nubes puede be adversely affected"
" por setting este valor too low."

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:15
msgid "Usage Retainment"
msgstr "Usage Retainment"

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:16
msgid ""
"Determines how many days to keep account usage (metered costing data) "
"records. Retainment period is not set by default. Usage records will remain "
"indefinitely if Usage Retainment is not set. Note this does not affect "
"generated Invoice records."
msgstr ""
"Determina how muchos days a keep cuenta usage (metered costing data) "
"records. Retainment period es no establecido de forma predeterminada. Usage "
"records va a remain indefinitely si Usage Retainment es no establecido. Note"
" este hace no affect generated Invoice records."

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:17
msgid "Incident Retainment"
msgstr "Incident Retainment"

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:18
msgid ""
"Enter the number of days |morpheus| should keep incident records in the "
"database. In general, this setting can be left alone but in certain cases "
"may need to be adjusted as very large incident database tables can affect "
"the stability of the application."
msgstr ""
"Enter el número de days |morpheus| debería keep incident records en el "
"database. En general, este setting puede ser left alone pero en cierto cases"
" puede need a be adjusted as very large incident database tables puede "
"affect el stability de el application."

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:19
msgid "Stats Retainment"
msgstr "Stats Retainment"

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:20
msgid ""
"Select 30, 60 or 90 days period for stats retainment. Selecting a larger "
"period gives the ability to analyze stats, such as Instance metrics, over a "
"longer period of time. For example, in the Monitoring tab of an Instance "
"detail page, users can select a 60 or 90-day analysis period if the stats "
"have been retained that long"
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar 30, 60 o 90 days period para stats retainment. Selecting a "
"larger period gives el ability a analyze stats, como Instancia metrics, over"
" a longer period de time. Por ejemplo, en el Monitoreo pestaña de un "
"Instancia detalle página, usuarios puede seleccionar a 60 o 90-day analysis "
"period si el stats han sido retained ese long"

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:21
msgid "Denied Hosts"
msgstr "Denied Hosts"

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:22
msgid ""
"A comma-delimited list of IP addresses and/or hostnames which should not be "
"allowed sources for HTTP Tasks or REST-populated Option Lists."
msgstr ""
"Un comma-delimited lista de IP addresses y/o hostnames que debería no be "
"allowed orígenes para HTTP Tareas o REST-populated Opción Lists."

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:23
msgid "Approved Hosts"
msgstr "Approved Hosts"

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:24
msgid ""
"A comma-delimited list of IP addresses and/or hostnames which are the only "
"approved sources for HTTP Tasks or REST-populated Option Lists. By entering "
"any values here, all others are automatically denied."
msgstr ""
"Un comma-delimited lista de IP addresses y/o hostnames que son el solo "
"approved orígenes para HTTP Tareas o REST-populated Opción Lists. Por "
"entering cualquier valores here, todos others son automáticamente denied."

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:25
msgid "Enable SSL Verification of Agent (Communications)"
msgstr "Enable SSL Verification de Agent (Communications)"

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:26
msgid ""
"Enabling SSL Verification of Agent Communications requires a valid "
"Certificate be installed on the Appliance."
msgstr ""
"Enabling SSL Verification de Agent Communications requiere a valid "
"Certificate be installed en el Appliance."

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:27
msgid "Disable SSH Password Authentication"
msgstr "Disable SSH Contraseña Autenticación"

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:28
msgid ""
"Only allow ssh login using SSH keys. When true, SSH Password Authentication "
"will not be enabled for VM's and Hosts provisioned after the setting is "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"Solo permitir ssh inicio de sesión usando SSH keys. Cuando true, SSH "
"Contraseña Autenticación no be habilitado para VM's y Hosts provisioned "
"después de el setting está habilitado."

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:29
msgid "Default Appliance Locale"
msgstr "Predeterminado Appliance Locale"

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:30
msgid ""
"Sets the default language and region for all users on the |morpheus| "
"appliance. Users with individual language preferences may also override this"
" selection on their User Settings page"
msgstr ""
"Sets el predeterminado language y region para todos usuarios en el "
"|morpheus| appliance. Usuarios con individual language preferences puede "
"también override este selection en su Usuario Configuración página"

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:31
msgid "Default Console Gateway"
msgstr "Predeterminado Console Gateway"

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:32
msgid ""
"Select a configured |morpheus| Worker as a console gateway or VDI gateway. "
"For more on installation and configuration of a gateway, see the `VDI "
"Gateways section "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/tools/vdi_pools.html#vdi-"
"gateways>`_ of |morpheus| documentation."
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar a configurado |morpheus| Worker as a console gateway o VDI "
"gateway. Para más en instalación y configuración de a gateway, consulte la "
"`VDI Gateways sección "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/tools/vdi_pools.html#vdi-"
"gateways>`_ de |morpheus| documentation."

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:33
msgid "Max Option List Size"
msgstr "Max Opción Lista Size"

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:34
msgid ""
"Sets a maximum size for Option Lists (such as those sourced from REST calls "
"to a remote server) to preserve appliance performance in the event that a "
"very large payload is inadvertently accessed. The entered number is "
"multiplied by 1000 (for example, entering \"1\" results in a maximum list "
"size of 1000)."
msgstr ""
"Sets a maximum size para Opción Lists (como esos sourced desde REST calls a "
"a remote servidor) a preserve appliance performance en el event ese a very "
"large payload es inadvertently accessed. El entered número es multiplied por"
" 1000 (por ejemplo, entering \"1\" results en a maximum lista size de 1000)."

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:36
msgid "Dashboards to Display"
msgstr "Dashboards a Mostrar"

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:36
msgid ""
"A typeahead field which will show all Dashboards available to the appliance "
"from Dashboard-type plugins. Select all desired Dashboards and they will be "
"displayed in the order set. Dashboards can be dragged up and down the list "
"to set the order correctly."
msgstr ""
"Un typeahead campo que va a show todos Dashboards disponible a el appliance "
"desde Dashboard-tipo plugins. Seleccionar todos desired Dashboards y ellos "
"será mostrado en el order establecido. Dashboards puede ser dragged up y "
"down el lista a establecido el order correctly."

#: ../../administration/settings/tenant_management.rst:2
msgid "Tenant Management Settings"
msgstr "Inquilino Gestión Configuración"

#: ../../administration/settings/tenant_management.rst:4
msgid "Registration Enabled"
msgstr "Registration Habilitado"

#: ../../administration/settings/tenant_management.rst:5
msgid ""
"If enabled, the appliance login screen will have a \"NEED AN ACCOUNT? SIGN "
"UP HERE\" link added, enabling new Tenant registration."
msgstr ""
"Si habilitado, el appliance inicio de sesión screen va a tienen a \"NEED AN "
"ACCOUNT? SIGN UP HERE\" link agregado, enabling nuevo Inquilino "
"registration."

#: ../../administration/settings/tenant_management.rst:6
msgid "Default Tenant Role"
msgstr "Predeterminado Rol de Inquilino"

#: ../../administration/settings/tenant_management.rst:7
msgid ""
"Sets the default Tenant Role applied to Tenants created from Tenant "
"Registration."
msgstr ""
"Sets el predeterminado Rol de Inquilino aplicado a Inquilinos creado desde "
"Inquilino Registration."

#: ../../administration/settings/tenant_management.rst:9
msgid "Default User Role"
msgstr "Predeterminado Rol de Usuario"

#: ../../administration/settings/tenant_management.rst:9
msgid ""
"Sets the default User Role applied to the User created from a Tenant "
"Registration."
msgstr ""
"Sets el predeterminado Rol de Usuario aplicado a el Usuario creado desde a "
"Inquilino Registration."

#: ../../administration/settings/user_management.rst:2
msgid "User Management Settings"
msgstr "Usuario Gestión Configuración"

#: ../../administration/settings/user_management.rst:4
msgid "Min Password Length"
msgstr "Min Contraseña Length"

#: ../../administration/settings/user_management.rst:5
msgid ""
"User passwords must at least be as many characters in length as the entered "
"value"
msgstr ""
"Usuario contraseñas debe en least be as muchos characters en length as el "
"entered valor"

#: ../../administration/settings/user_management.rst:6
msgid "Min Password Uppercase"
msgstr "Min Contraseña Uppercase"

#: ../../administration/settings/user_management.rst:7
msgid ""
"User passwords must include at least as many uppercase characters as the "
"entered value"
msgstr ""
"Usuario contraseñas debe include en least as muchos uppercase characters as "
"el entered valor"

#: ../../administration/settings/user_management.rst:8
msgid "Min Password Numbers"
msgstr "Min Contraseña Numbers"

#: ../../administration/settings/user_management.rst:9
msgid ""
"User passwords must include at least as many numerals as the entered value"
msgstr ""
"Usuario contraseñas debe include en least as muchos numerals as el entered "
"valor"

#: ../../administration/settings/user_management.rst:10
msgid "Min Password Symbols"
msgstr "Min Contraseña Symbols"

#: ../../administration/settings/user_management.rst:11
msgid ""
"User passwords must include at least as many special characters as the "
"entered value"
msgstr ""
"Usuario contraseñas debe include en least as muchos special characters as el"
" entered valor"

#: ../../administration/settings/user_management.rst:12
msgid "Session Expires (Minutes)"
msgstr "Session Expires (Minutes)"

#: ../../administration/settings/user_management.rst:13
msgid ""
"A user session is forcibly logged out after the entered number of minutes of"
" inactivity"
msgstr ""
"Un usuario session es forcibly logged out después de el entered número de "
"minutes de inactivity"

#: ../../administration/settings/user_management.rst:14
msgid "Session Warning (Minutes)"
msgstr "Session Warning (Minutes)"

#: ../../administration/settings/user_management.rst:15
msgid ""
"A pop-up warning is shown to the user when they have been inactive for the "
"number of minutes entered. Example: If sessions are set to expire after 90 "
"minutes, warn the user after 60 minutes if you intend to provide 30 minutes "
"advance warning"
msgstr ""
"Un pop-up warning es shown a el usuario cuando ellos han sido inactive para "
"el número de minutes entered. Ejemplo: Si sessions son establecido a expire "
"después de 90 minutes, warn el usuario después de 60 minutes si usted intend"
" a provide 30 minutes advance warning"

#: ../../administration/settings/user_management.rst:16
msgid "Expire Password After (Days)"
msgstr "Expire Contraseña Después de (Days)"

#: ../../administration/settings/user_management.rst:17
msgid ""
"User account passwords will expire after the entered number of days. Enter 0"
" or leave the field empty to opt out of this feature."
msgstr ""
"Usuario cuenta contraseñas va a expire después de el entered número de days."
" Enter 0 o leave el campo empty a opt out de este característica."

#: ../../administration/settings/user_management.rst:18
msgid "Disable User After Attempts (Number of Attempts)"
msgstr "Disable Usuario Después de Attempts (Número de Attempts)"

#: ../../administration/settings/user_management.rst:19
msgid ""
"Disable a User account after a specified number of failed login attempts. "
"Enter 0 or leave the field empty to opt out of this feature."
msgstr ""
"Disable a Usuario cuenta después de a specified número de failed inicio de "
"sesión attempts. Enter 0 o leave el campo empty a opt out de este "
"característica."

#: ../../administration/settings/user_management.rst:20
msgid "Disable User If Inactive For (Days)"
msgstr "Disable Usuario Si Inactive Para (Days)"

#: ../../administration/settings/user_management.rst:21
msgid ""
"Disable a User account if inactive for the entered number of days. The User "
"will not be able to log into the appliance again until another User with "
"sufficient rights enables the account. Enter 0 or leave the field empty to "
"opt out of this feature."
msgstr ""
"Disable a Usuario cuenta si inactive para el entered número de days. El "
"Usuario no be able a log en el appliance again until another Usuario con "
"sufficient rights enables el cuenta. Enter 0 o leave el campo empty a opt "
"out de este característica."

#: ../../administration/settings/user_management.rst:23
msgid "Send warning email before deactivating (Days)"
msgstr "Send warning correo electrónico antes de deactivating (Days)"

#: ../../administration/settings/user_management.rst:23
msgid ""
"Enter the number of days prior to account deactivation that a warning email "
"should be sent. For example, enter \"5\" to warn the User when they are five"
" days short of the deactivation time entered in the prior field. Enter 0 or "
"leave the field empty to opt out of this feature."
msgstr ""
"Enter el número de days prior a cuenta deactivation ese a warning correo "
"electrónico debería ser sent. Por ejemplo, enter \"5\" a warn el Usuario "
"cuando ellos son five days short de el deactivation time entered en el prior"
" campo. Enter 0 o leave el campo empty a opt out de este característica."

#: ../../administration/settings/email.rst:2
msgid "Email Settings"
msgstr "Correo electrónico Configuración"

#: ../../administration/settings/email.rst:4
msgid ""
"In this section, you can configure an SMTP server for email notification "
"delivery. You will need to provide |morpheus| the following information, "
"your mail server systems administrator can assist you in filling these "
"fields and with the preferred encryption method."
msgstr ""
"En este sección, usted puede configure un SMTP servidor para correo "
"electrónico notification delivery. You va a need a provide |morpheus| lo "
"siguiente information, su mail servidor systems administrator puede assist "
"usted en filling estos campos y con el preferred encryption method."

#: ../../administration/settings/email.rst:6
msgid "From Address"
msgstr "Desde Address"

#: ../../administration/settings/email.rst:7
msgid "SMTP Server"
msgstr "SMTP Servidor"

#: ../../administration/settings/email.rst:8
msgid "SMTP Port"
msgstr "SMTP Port"

#: ../../administration/settings/email.rst:9
msgid "SSL Enabled"
msgstr "SSL Habilitado"

#: ../../administration/settings/email.rst:10
msgid "TLS Encryption"
msgstr "TLS Encryption"

#: ../../administration/settings/email.rst:11
msgid "SMTP User"
msgstr "SMTP Usuario"

#: ../../administration/settings/email.rst:12
msgid "SMTP Password"
msgstr "SMTP Contraseña"

#: ../../administration/settings/email.rst:14
msgid ""
"We recommend that you add the |morpheus| server to your SMTP whitelist as "
"well as using user authentication as an additional security measure."
msgstr ""
"We recommend ese usted agregar el |morpheus| servidor a su SMTP whitelist "
"así como usando usuario autenticación as un adicional seguridad measure."

#: ../../administration/settings/email.rst:16
msgid ""
"Once you have added your SMTP server information into |morpheus|, scroll "
"down to the bottom of the page and press the blue SAVE button which can be "
"found under the Enabled Clouds section."
msgstr ""
"Once usted tienen agregado su SMTP servidor information en |morpheus|, "
"scroll down a el bottom de el página y press el blue SAVE botón que se puede"
" encontrar under el Habilitado Nubes sección."

#: ../../administration/settings/email.rst:18
msgid ""
"When you have saved your SMTP server settings in the |morpheus| appliance "
"you will then need to restart the UI. To restart the morpheus-ui, connect to"
" your |morpheus| server via SSH and run the below command:"
msgstr ""
"Cuando usted tienen saved su SMTP servidor configuración en el |morpheus| "
"appliance usted va a then need a restart el UI. Un restart el morpheus-ui, "
"connect a su |morpheus| servidor a través de SSH y run el below command:"

#: ../../administration/settings/email.rst:20
msgid "``sudo morpheus-ctl restart morpheus-ui``"
msgstr "``sudo morpheus-ctl restart morpheus-ui``"

#: ../../administration/settings/email.rst:22
msgid ""
"If you do not restart morpheus-ui, the notifications will not be sent. "
"Please note it can take up to three minutes for the UI to become reachable "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Si usted hacer no restart morpheus-ui, el notifications no be sent. Tenga en"
" cuenta ello puede take up a three minutes para el UI a become reachable "
"again."

#: ../../administration/settings/sms.rst:2
msgid "Twilio SMS Settings"
msgstr "Twilio SMS Configuración"

#: ../../administration/settings/sms.rst:4
msgid ""
"Configure SMS text message delivery for |morpheus| alerts. Previously, "
"customers could use |morpheus|’ own account for delivery, but for security "
"reasons clients must now supply their own. Complete the fields indicated "
"below and then restart all |morpheus| nodes to apply the changes."
msgstr ""
"Configure SMS text message delivery para |morpheus| alerts. Previously, "
"customers could usar |morpheus|’ own cuenta para delivery, pero para "
"seguridad reasons clients debe now supply su own. Complete el campos "
"indicated below y then restart todos |morpheus| nodes a aplicar el changes."

#: ../../administration/settings/sms.rst:6
msgid "**Account SID:** Twilio Account SID"
msgstr "**Cuenta SID:** Twilio Cuenta SID"

#: ../../administration/settings/sms.rst:7
msgid "**SMS From #:** The \"From\" number to receive the text message from"
msgstr "**SMS From #:** El \"Desde\" número a receive el text message desde"

#: ../../administration/settings/sms.rst:8
msgid "**Auth Token:** The Twilio API authentication token for your account"
msgstr "**Auth Token:** El Twilio API autenticación token para su cuenta"

#: ../../administration/settings/proxy.rst:2
msgid "Proxy Settings"
msgstr "Proxy Configuración"

#: ../../administration/settings/proxy.rst:4
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| Appliance can be configured to communicate through a Proxy "
"server for Cloud API's and Agent communication back to the Appliance."
msgstr ""
"El |morpheus| Appliance se puede configurar a communicate a través de a "
"Proxy servidor para Nube API's y Agent communication back a el Appliance."

#: ../../administration/settings/proxy.rst:6
msgid ""
"Additional Proxy configuration is available in the `Infrastructure > Network"
" > Proxies` section. Added Proxies can be scoped to Clouds in the `Edit "
"Cloud > Advanced Options` section of the Cloud."
msgstr ""
"Additional Proxy configuración está disponible en el `Infraestructura > Red "
"> Proxies` sección. Agregado Proxies puede ser scoped a Nubes en el `Editar "
"Nube > Advanced Opciones` sección de el Nube."

#: ../../administration/settings/proxy.rst:8
msgid "Add a Global Proxy server by entering the following:"
msgstr "Agregar a Global Proxy servidor por entering lo siguiente:"

#: ../../administration/settings/proxy.rst:10
msgid "Proxy Host"
msgstr "Proxy Host"

#: ../../administration/settings/proxy.rst:11
msgid "Proxy Port"
msgstr "Proxy Port"

#: ../../administration/settings/proxy.rst:12
msgid "Proxy User"
msgstr "Proxy Usuario"

#: ../../administration/settings/proxy.rst:13
msgid "Proxy Password"
msgstr "Proxy Contraseña"

#: ../../administration/settings/proxy.rst:14
msgid "Proxy Domain"
msgstr "Proxy Domain"

#: ../../administration/settings/proxy.rst:15
msgid "Proxy Workstation"
msgstr "Proxy Workstation"

#: ../../administration/settings/currency.rst:2
msgid "Currency Settings"
msgstr "Currency Configuración"

#: ../../administration/settings/currency.rst:4
msgid ""
"In |morpheus|, Tenants are separate environments which can be defined as "
"using currencies that are unique from one Tenant to the next. In addition, "
"these currencies may be different from the currency in which Price Sets have"
" been defined. In order to present pricing to Subtenant users in their "
"designated currency, |morpheus| allows for integration with currency "
"conversion services \"open exchange rates\" and \"fixer.io\". This article "
"goes through the process of setting up the integration and how it works to "
"determine pricing conversions."
msgstr ""
"En |morpheus|, Inquilinos son separate entornos que puede ser defined as "
"usando currencies ese son único desde uno Inquilino a el next. Además, estos"
" currencies puede be diferente desde el currency en que Precio Sets han sido"
" defined. Para poder present pricing a Subinquilino usuarios en su "
"designated currency, |morpheus| permite para integración con currency "
"conversion services \"open exchange rates\" y \"fixer.io\". Este article "
"goes a través de el process de setting up el integración y how ello works a "
"determine pricing conversions."

#: ../../administration/settings/currency.rst:7
msgid "Integrating With a Currency Exchange Provider"
msgstr "Integrating Con a Currency Exchange Provider"

#: ../../administration/settings/currency.rst:9
msgid "Navigate to |AdmSetApp|"
msgstr "Navegue a |AdmSetApp|"

#: ../../administration/settings/currency.rst:10
msgid ""
"Under the Currency Settings heading, make a \"Currency Provider\" selection"
msgstr ""
"Under el Currency Configuración heading, make a \"Currency Provider\" "
"selection"

#: ../../administration/settings/currency.rst:11
msgid "Enter your \"Provider API Key\""
msgstr "Enter su \"Provider API Key\""

#: ../../administration/settings/currency.rst:13
msgid ""
"The service is now integrated and can be used as described in the next "
"section."
msgstr ""
"El service es now integrated y puede ser usado as described en el next "
"sección."

#: ../../administration/settings/currency.rst:16
msgid "Consuming Currency Exchange in |morpheus|"
msgstr "Consuming Currency Exchange en |morpheus|"

#: ../../administration/settings/currency.rst:18
msgid ""
"Currency exchange data is synced from the integrated provider once every 12 "
"hours. When needed, Morpheus will use this cached data to present currency "
"conversions rather than hitting the API directly each time. This limits the "
"total number of API hits and reduces costs."
msgstr ""
"Currency exchange data es synced desde el integrated provider once every 12 "
"hours. Cuando needed, Morpheus va a usar este cached data a present currency"
" conversions rather than hitting el API directly cada time. Este limits el "
"total número de API hits y reduces costs."

#: ../../administration/settings/currency.rst:20
