#: ../../administration/settings/logs.rst:2
msgid "Logging Settings"
msgstr "Logging Configuración"

#: ../../administration/settings/logs.rst:7
msgid ""
"|morpheus| contains a built-in logging solution that aggregates logs from "
"hosts and services. Logs are displayed, searchable, and filterable in the "
"Instance, App, Host and global Logs (|MonLog|) sections. Logs can also be "
"forwarded using Syslog forward rules to any external solution that supports "
"Syslogs."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| contiene a built-en logging solution ese aggregates logs desde "
"hosts y services. Logs son mostrado, searchable, y filterable en el "
"Instancia, App, Host y global Logs (|MonLog|) sections. Logs puede también "
"be forwarded usando Syslog forward rules a cualquier external solution ese "
"supports Syslogs."

#: ../../administration/settings/logs.rst:9
msgid ""
"The logs displayed in the Instance, App, Host and overall Logs (|MonLog|) "
"sections are only from managed VMs and Hosts that have the |morpheus| Agent "
"installed. |morpheus| Agent will watch ``/var/logs`` for any .log file and "
"report them back accordingly. Containerized Instances can be configured to "
"show additional logs by configuring the LOG FOLDER in the Library NODE TYPE."
" Logs from any .log file in the specified folder will be forwarded by the "
"|morpheus| Agent to the |morpheus| appliance or forwarded with Syslog "
"forward rules."
msgstr ""
"El logs mostrado en el Instancia, App, Host y overall Logs (|MonLog|) "
"sections son solo desde gestionado VMs y Hosts ese tienen el |morpheus| "
"Agent installed. |morpheus| Agent va a watch ``/var/logs`` para cualquier "
".log file y report them back accordingly. Containerized Instancias se puede "
"configurar a show adicional logs por configuring el LOG FOLDER en el Library"
" NODE TYPE. Logs desde cualquier .log file en el specified folder será "
"forwarded por el |morpheus| Agent a el |morpheus| appliance o forwarded con "
"Syslog forward rules."

#: ../../administration/settings/logs.rst:11
msgid ""
"The `Logs` section does not contain |morpheus| appliance logs, which can be "
"found in `/var/log/morpheus/` and in |AdmHea|."
msgstr ""
"El `Logs` sección hace no contain |morpheus| appliance logs, que se puede "
"encontrar en `/var/log/morpheus/` y en |AdmHea|."

#: ../../administration/settings/logs.rst:13
msgid ""
"Logs are stored in ElasticSearch and retention can be set by adjusting the "
"Availability Time Frame in the |AdmSetMon| section. Logging can also be "
"disabled with a simple toggle switch just above the Availability Time Frame "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"Logs son stored en ElasticSearch y retention se puede establecer por "
"adjusting el Availability Time Frame en el |AdmSetMon| sección. Logging "
"puede también be deshabilitado con a simple toggle switch just above el "
"Availability Time Frame configuración."

#: ../../internal administration/settings/logs.rst:16 after padding
msgid ".. image:: images/administration/settings/logSettings.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/administration/settings/logSettings.png"

#: ../../administration/settings/settings.rst:48
msgid "Backups"
msgstr "Backups"

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:2
msgid "Backup Settings"
msgstr "Backup Configuración"

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Backup settings page allows you enable or disable scheduled backups, "
"select a default backup bucket, and administer global settings related to "
"backups. Changes to global settings only affect new backups going forward "
"and do not affect existing backups."
msgstr ""
"El Backup configuración página permite usted enable o disable scheduled "
"backups, seleccionar a predeterminado backup bucket, y administer global "
"configuración relacionado con backups. Changes a global configuración solo "
"affect nuevo backups going forward y hacer no affect existente backups."

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:6
msgid ""
"Appliance backups are subject to a two-hour time limit to complete the "
"backup. Automated backup attempts will be abandoned and will fail once this "
"time limit is exceeded."
msgstr ""
"Appliance backups son subject a a two-hour time limit a complete el backup. "
"Automated backup attempts será abandoned y va a fail once este time limit es"
" exceeded."

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:8
msgid ""
"Appliances with an HA architecture containing multiple app nodes must ensure"
" all nodes can access stored backups. By default, if no \"Default Backup "
"Bucket\" configuration is made, backups are stored in "
"``/var/opt/morpheus/bitcan``. If this path is local to the app nodes, all "
"other app nodes would not be able to reach the backups. In such a case, one "
"solution would be to create an NFS share for the ``bitcan`` directory for "
"all app nodes. Another solution would be to make a \"Default Backup Bucket\""
" configuration selection, which all nodes would then use for backup storage "
"and retrieval."
msgstr ""
"Appliances con un HA architecture containing múltiples app nodes debe "
"asegurar todos nodes puede acceso stored backups. De forma predeterminada, "
"si no \"Predeterminado Backup Bucket\" configuración es made, backups son "
"stored en ``/var/opt/morpheus/bitcan``. Si este path es local a el app "
"nodes, todos otro app nodes would no be able a reach el backups. En such a "
"case, uno solution would be a crear un NFS share para el ``bitcan`` "
"directory para todos app nodes. Another solution would be a make a "
"\"Predeterminado Backup Bucket\" configuración selection, que todos nodes "
"would then usar para backup storage y retrieval."

