#: ../../administration/settings/settings.rst:78
msgid "Utilities"
msgstr "Utilities"

#: ../../administration/settings/utilities.rst:1
msgid ""
"System administrators have access to a utilities panel with the following "
"options:"
msgstr ""
"System administrators tienen acceso a a utilities panel con lo siguiente "
"opciones:"

#: ../../administration/settings/utilities.rst:3
msgid "**Reindex all searchable data:** Execute"
msgstr "**Reindex all searchable data:** Execute"

#: ../../administration/settings/utilities.rst:4
msgid "**Toggle Maintenance Mode:** Enable"
msgstr "**Toggle Maintenance Mode:** Enable"

#: ../../administration/settings/utilities.rst:6
msgid ""
"Maintenance mode cleanly places |morpheus| into a state where maintenance "
"can be performed on the appliance. This drains any active sessions and "
"queues so an auto-scaling group can scale down. It also drains active "
"sessions across services. Restarting |morpheus| UI disables maintenance "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"Maintenance mode cleanly places |morpheus| en a state donde maintenance "
"puede ser performed en el appliance. Este drains cualquier active sessions y"
" queues so un auto-scaling grupo puede scale down. It también drains active "
"sessions a través de services. Restarting |morpheus| UI disables maintenance"
" mode."

#: ../../administration/settings/utilities.rst:8
msgid ""
"When using |morpheus| in a Highly Available (HA) environment, it is "
"important to navigate to a node directly and enable maintenance mode, as "
"opposed to using the load balancer virtual IP (VIP). A local host entry to "
"the specific node may be required to ensure the correct node enters "
"mainteance mode. In fact, it is recommended to use the `analogous API "
"endpoint "
"<https://apidocs.morpheusdata.com/reference/setappliancesettingsmaintenancemode>`_"
" to toggle a specific node into maintenance mode to avoid redirects back to "
"the VIP address."
msgstr ""
"Cuando usando |morpheus| en a Highly Disponible (HA) entorno, ello es "
"important a navegue a a node directly y enable maintenance mode, as opposed "
"a usando el load balancer virtual IP (VIP). Un local host entry a el "
"específico node puede be requerido a asegurar el correct node enters "
"mainteance mode. En fact, ello es recomendado a usar el `analogous API "
"endpoint "
"<https://apidocs.morpheusdata.com/reference/setapplianceconfiguraciónmaintenancemode>`_"
" a toggle a específico node en maintenance mode a avoid redirects back a el "
"VIP address."

#: ../../administration/settings/utilities.rst:10
msgid ""
"A |morpheus| node in maintenance mode can still be accessible through the "
"load balancer VIP/target group and can queue requests but will not process "
"anything in queue, while in maintenance mode. A node can be removed/paused "
"from the load balancer VIP or have VIP health checks implemented, if the "
"node UI/API will become inaccessible due to maintenance."
msgstr ""
"Un |morpheus| node en maintenance mode puede still be accessible a través de"
" el load balancer VIP/target grupo y puede queue requests pero no process "
"anything en queue, while en maintenance mode. Un node puede ser "
"removed/paused desde el load balancer VIP o tienen VIP health checks "
"implemented, si el node UI/API serácome inaccessible due a maintenance."
